OL,3,GNEWSATwin sisters turn life and illness
OL,4,Ainto comedy play
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo sisters have turned a lifetime of
OL,7,Fquestions about being identical twins
OL,8,Finto an autobiographical comedy that
OL,9,Fexplores family, illness and
OL,10,Fresilience.
OL,12,FAnna and Georgina Lewis, from Hastings,
OL,13,Finitially wrote about challenging the
OL,14,Fcommon misconceptions of twins.
OL,16,FHowever the project took on a more
OL,17,Fpersonal focus when Anna was diagnosed
OL,18,Fwith breast cancer in 2024 shortly
OL,19,Fafter the sisters' 40th birthday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
