OL,3,GNEWSATwin sisters turn life and illness
OL,4,Ainto comedy play
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Throughout my treatment, I wrote
OL,7,Fletters to Georgina to process what was
OL,8,Fhappening and to help pass time," Anna
OL,9,Ftold the BBC.
